{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19105","headline":"洛中寺北楼见贺监草书题诗 · 刘禹锡","name":"洛中寺北楼见贺监草书题诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高楼贺监昔曾登，壁上笔踪龙虎腾。\n中国书流尚皇象，北朝文士重徐陵。\n偶因独见空惊目，恨不同时便伏膺。\n唯恐尘埃转磨灭，再三珍重嘱山僧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}